  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">In the Babylon wallet mobile app, select the <strong id=\"\">settings</strong> gear in the top right-hand corner, click <strong id=\"\">Personas,</strong> select <strong id=\"\">Create new Persona, and </strong>then<strong id=\"\"> Continue.</strong></p><p id=\"\">Select a Persona name and <strong id=\"\">Continue</strong>. The wallet will now request biometric authentication to create a new persona.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">Authenticate and <strong id=\"\">Continue.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">Continue to the Persona list.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Congratulations, your new Persona has been created.</strong></p>",
